<div class="u" data-mode="{{mode}}" style="background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); min-height: 780px;">
  <header class="top" style="padding: 20px 48px;">
    <span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--ink);">Quality callout</span>
    <span class="m" style="font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--mut); letter-spacing: 0.06em;">THREE WAYS TO SAY IT WITHOUT THE GREEN CARD</span>
    <div style="flex-grow: 1;"></div>
    <button class="ni" style="width: auto;" onClick="{{toggleTheme}}" aria-label="{{switchLabel}}">
      <sc-if value="{{dark}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{true}}">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle>
          <path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M2 12h2M20 12h2M5 5l1.5 1.5M17.5 17.5L19 19M19 5l-1.5 1.5M6.5 17.5L5 19"></path>
        </svg>
      </sc-if>
      <sc-if value="{{light}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{true}}">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M21 13a8.5 8.5 0 01-10-10 8.5 8.5 0 1010 10z"></path>
        </svg>
      </sc-if>
    </button>
  </header>
  <div class="sheet">
    <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--mut-read); line-height: 1.6; margin: 30px 0 0; max-width: 92ch;">
      The same curve in all three. Only the way quality gets stated changes. What is on the sign in screen now
      is the filled green card sitting in the top right of the plot.
    </p>
    <div class="grid3">
      <div>
        <div class="vname"><span class="vtag">A</span>On the points</div>
        <div class="vnote">The card goes, and every point on the line becomes a tick. Four ticks say at every step without a sentence having to, and the only words left are one quiet green line. The most confident of the three.</div>
        <div class="stage"><div class="exhibit"><svg viewBox="0 0 480 300" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Cost falling from one hundred and twenty dollars today to five, with quality shown as held at every step."><text x="60" y="40" class="m" font-size="11" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.3" fill="var(--ok)">QUALITY HELD AT EVERY POINT</text><path d="M60 88 C104 88 134 140 172 155 C212 171 240 192 276 203 C312 214 348 224 378 228 L378 252 L60 252 Z" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="0.10"></path><path d="M60 88 C104 88 134 140 172 155 C212 171 240 192 276 203 C312 214 348 224 378 228" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M394 228 H424" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.4" opacity="0.45" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M419 223 l5 5 -5 5" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.4" opacity="0.45" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="60" cy="88" r="9" fill="var(--mut)" opacity="1.0"></circle><path d="M56.4 88 L58.8 90.5 L63.9 85.0" fill="none" stroke="var(--raise)" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><text x="60" y="62" text-anchor="middle" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ink)">$120</text><circle cx="172" cy="155" r="9" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="0.45"></circle><path d="M168.4 155 L170.8 157.5 L175.9 152.0" fill="none" stroke="var(--raise)" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><text x="172" y="129" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ink)">$40</text><circle cx="276" cy="203" r="9" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="0.72"></circle><path d="M272.4 203 L274.8 205.5 L279.9 200.0" fill="none" stroke="var(--raise)" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><text x="276" y="177" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ink)">$12</text><circle cx="378" cy="228" r="10" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="1.0"></circle><path d="M374.4 228 L376.8 230.5 L381.9 225.0" fill="none" stroke="var(--raise)" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><text x="378" y="201" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ok)">$5</text><line x1="30" y1="252" x2="452" y2="252" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.6"></line><text x="32" y="278" font-size="13.5" fill="var(--mut)">Today</text><text x="452" y="278" text-anchor="end" font-size="13.5" fill="var(--mut)">Continuously gets better &#8594;</text></svg></div></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="vname"><span class="vtag">B</span>A second line</div>
        <div class="vnote">Quality stops being a claim and becomes a series: one flat green line above the falling one, with both labelled. It is the literal picture of what the copy above promises, and it fills the same empty corner the card was covering.</div>
        <div class="stage"><div class="exhibit"><svg viewBox="0 0 480 300" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Cost falling from one hundred and twenty dollars today to five, with quality shown as held at every step."><path d="M60 88 C104 88 134 140 172 155 C212 171 240 192 276 203 C312 214 348 224 378 228 L378 252 L60 252 Z" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="0.10"></path><path d="M60 88 C104 88 134 140 172 155 C212 171 240 192 276 203 C312 214 348 224 378 228" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><line x1="60" y1="38" x2="424" y2="38" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-dasharray="6 5"></line><circle cx="378" cy="38" r="4.5" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><circle cx="276" cy="38" r="4.5" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><circle cx="172" cy="38" r="4.5" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><circle cx="60" cy="38" r="4.5" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><path d="M394 228 H424" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.4" opacity="0.45" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M419 223 l5 5 -5 5" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.4" opacity="0.45" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="60" cy="88" r="9" fill="var(--mut)" opacity="1.0"></circle><circle cx="60" cy="88" r="3.6" fill="var(--raise)"></circle><text x="60" y="62" text-anchor="middle" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ink)">$120</text><circle cx="172" cy="155" r="9" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="0.45"></circle><circle cx="172" cy="155" r="3.6" fill="var(--raise)"></circle><text x="172" y="129" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ink)">$40</text><circle cx="276" cy="203" r="9" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="0.72"></circle><circle cx="276" cy="203" r="3.6" fill="var(--raise)"></circle><text x="276" y="177" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ink)">$12</text><circle cx="378" cy="228" r="10" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="1.0"></circle><circle cx="378" cy="228" r="3.6" fill="var(--raise)"></circle><text x="378" y="201" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ok)">$5</text><line x1="30" y1="252" x2="452" y2="252" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.6"></line><text x="32" y="278" font-size="13.5" fill="var(--mut)">Today</text><text x="452" y="278" text-anchor="end" font-size="13.5" fill="var(--mut)">Continuously gets better &#8594;</text><text x="60" y="24" class="m" font-size="11" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.3" fill="var(--ok)">QUALITY</text><text x="452" y="24" text-anchor="end" font-size="12.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ok)">holds, every step</text><text x="32" y="120" class="m" font-size="11" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.3" fill="var(--mut)">COST</text></svg></div></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="vname"><span class="vtag">C</span>Just the sentence</div>
        <div class="vnote">Same words, same tick, no container. Often the card is the problem and not the copy. Lightest change of the three and the only one that keeps the wording exactly as it is.</div>
        <div class="stage"><div class="exhibit"><svg viewBox="0 0 480 300" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Cost falling from one hundred and twenty dollars today to five, with quality shown as held at every step."><path d="M60 88 C104 88 134 140 172 155 C212 171 240 192 276 203 C312 214 348 224 378 228 L378 252 L60 252 Z" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="0.10"></path><path d="M60 88 C104 88 134 140 172 155 C212 171 240 192 276 203 C312 214 348 224 378 228" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M394 228 H424" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.4" opacity="0.45" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M419 223 l5 5 -5 5" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.4" opacity="0.45" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="60" cy="88" r="9" fill="var(--mut)" opacity="1.0"></circle><circle cx="60" cy="88" r="3.6" fill="var(--raise)"></circle><text x="60" y="62" text-anchor="middle" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ink)">$120</text><circle cx="172" cy="155" r="9" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="0.45"></circle><circle cx="172" cy="155" r="3.6" fill="var(--raise)"></circle><text x="172" y="129" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ink)">$40</text><circle cx="276" cy="203" r="9" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="0.72"></circle><circle cx="276" cy="203" r="3.6" fill="var(--raise)"></circle><text x="276" y="177" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ink)">$12</text><circle cx="378" cy="228" r="10" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="1.0"></circle><circle cx="378" cy="228" r="3.6" fill="var(--raise)"></circle><text x="378" y="201" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="var(--ok)">$5</text><line x1="30" y1="252" x2="452" y2="252" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.6"></line><text x="32" y="278" font-size="13.5" fill="var(--mut)">Today</text><text x="452" y="278" text-anchor="end" font-size="13.5" fill="var(--mut)">Continuously gets better &#8594;</text><circle cx="256" cy="40" r="9" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><path d="M252.0 40 L254.6 42.7 L260.3 36.8" fill="none" stroke="var(--onbrand)" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><text x="452" y="45" text-anchor="end" font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">Quality holds at every step</text></svg></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
